<title>UK: TENNIS-SWEDEN, U.S. NAMED TOP SEEDS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SWEDEN, U.S. NAMED TOP SEEDS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden and the United States will</p>
<p>be the joint top seeds at the 1997 Davis Cup world group draw on</p>
<p>Tuesday.</p>
<p>The Americans have retained their status despite their shock</p>
<p>defeat by the Czech Republic in the quarter-finals this year.</p>
<p>Seeds 1-2 (all pairings equal): Sweden, U.S, seeds 3-4:</p>
<p>France, Germany, seeds 5-6: Czech Republic, Italy, seeds 7-8</p>
<p>Netherlands, Russia.</p>
<p>Other competing world group nations: Australia, Brazil,</p>
<p>India, Mexico, Romania, South Africa, Spain, Switzerland.</p>
</text>
